@startuml LiveSessionSequence
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Therapist" as T
participant "Live Control Room\n(JSP / Chart.js)" as CtrlRoom
participant "LiveControlServlet\n& CommandApiServlet" as Servlets
participant "CommandQueue\n(BlockingQueue / ReentrantLock)" as CQ
participant "TelemetrySimulator\n(Runnable Thread Pool)" as TS
participant "CrisisEngine\n(Strategy Pattern)" as CE
database "Database (JDBC)" as DB
participant "Connected VR Headset\n(A-Frame / WebXR)" as Headset
actor "Patient" as P

== 1. Live Session Initialization ==
T -> CtrlRoom: Launch Live Session #1 (Patient: Sarah)
CtrlRoom -> Servlets: POST /therapist/live-control (action=START)
Servlets -> DB: UPDATE live_sessions SET state='ACTIVE'
Servlets -> TS: startSimulation(sessionId=1)
TS -> TS: TelemetrySimulator thread begins heartbeat generation

== 2. Biometric Telemetry Polling (Every 2 Seconds) ==
loop Polling Interval (Every 2 Seconds via AJAX)
    CtrlRoom -> Servlets: GET /api/telemetry?sessionId=1
    Servlets -> DB: TelemetryDao.getLatest(sessionId=1)
    Servlets --> CtrlRoom: JSON {heartRate: 78, stress: 3, hrv: 62}
    CtrlRoom -> CtrlRoom: Chart.js dynamically redraws vitals graph
end

== 3. Remote Clinician Intervention via Thread-Safe CommandQueue ==
T -> CtrlRoom: Switch Environment -> "Night Sky" & Send Guidance: "Breathe with the sphere"
CtrlRoom -> Servlets: POST /therapist/live-control (command=SWITCH_ENV, prompt="Breathe...")
Servlets -> CQ: CommandQueue.enqueue(sessionId=1, VrCommand)
note over CQ: Synchronized thread-safe\nConcurrentHashMap & BlockingQueue

Headset -> Servlets: GET /api/command?sessionId=1 (AJAX Poll every 2s)
Servlets -> CQ: CommandQueue.poll(sessionId=1)
CQ --> Servlets: VrCommand("SWITCH_ENVIRONMENT", "Night Sky")
Servlets --> Headset: JSON {command: "SWITCH_ENVIRONMENT", payload: "Night Sky"}
Headset -> Headset: A-Frame updates skybox to starfield & renders floating HUD prompt

== 4. Emergency Stop Intervention ==
alt Patient presses in-VR emergency stop OR Therapist halts
    P -> Headset: Click floating "I NEED TO STOP" in VR
    Headset -> Servlets: POST /api/emergency-stop?sessionId=1
    Servlets -> DB: SessionDao.updateState(1, 'EMERGENCY_STOPPED')
    Servlets -> TS: TelemetrySimulator.stop()
    Servlets -> CQ: CommandQueue.enqueue(VrCommand("EMERGENCY_STOP"))
    Servlets --> Headset: Redirect to /patient/emergency-grounding (5-4-3-2-1 Somatic Grounding)
    CtrlRoom -> Servlets: Polling detects EMERGENCY_STOPPED
    CtrlRoom -> CtrlRoom: Sound alert & display emergency halt banner
end

@enduml
